<text><p></p><p id="q3">3. 
	    
	If your bank has tightened or eased its credit standards or
	its terms for C&amp;I loans or credit lines over the past
	three months (as described in questions 1 and
	2), how important have
	been the following possible reasons for the change? 
      </p></text>
<text><p id="q3A" style="padding-left: 3em;">A. 
	  Possible reasons for tightening credit standards or
	loan terms:</p></text>
<div data-table-popout class="data-table">
<text><p id="q3Aa" style="padding-left: 6em;">a.
