<p></p>

<p><em><strong>Questions 7-12</strong>
ask about changes 
      in standards and demand over the <strong>past three months</strong>
for three different
      types of CRE loans at your bank: construction and land development
      loans, loans secured by nonfarm nonresidential properties, and loans
      secured by multifamily residential properties. Please report 
      changes in enforcement of existing policies as changes in policies.
      </em>
</p>

